WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.104 --> 00:00:02.245
Hello! [s@Hello!

2
00:00:02.885 --> 00:00:03.846
Who are you?

3
00:00:04.146 --> 00:00:06.268
I'm a brown pelican.

4
00:00:06.728 --> 00:00:10.711
We are large seabirds.

5
00:00:10.751 --> 00:00:11.732
Where do you live?

6
00:00:30.836 --> 00:00:33.237
Brown pelicans live in North America.

7
00:00:34.877 --> 00:00:36.458
We live along the coast.

8
00:00:38.578 --> 00:00:40.039
We like the ocean.

9
00:00:42.259 --> 00:00:43.800
Where do you lay eggs?

10
00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.081
We make nests on cliffs.

11
00:00:48.941 --> 00:00:51.542
Sometimes we make nests in trees.

12
00:00:53.322 --> 00:00:54.683
Do you live alone?

13
00:00:56.163 --> 00:00:58.584
No. Brown pelicans live in groups.

14
00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.682
We like to fly over the water together.

15
00:01:05.184 --> 00:01:06.364
What do you eat?

16
00:01:08.706 --> 00:01:10.127
We mostly eat fish.

17
00:01:13.189 --> 00:01:15.931
Sometimes we eat shrimp or crabs.

18
00:01:18.213 --> 00:01:19.734
How do you find food?

19
00:01:21.355 --> 00:01:22.956
We hunt from up in the air.

20
00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.518
Then we dive down.

21
00:01:26.499 --> 00:01:27.920
And we scoop up fish!

22
00:01:30.792 --> 00:01:32.574
You have a big bill!

23
00:01:33.835 --> 00:01:35.357
Our bills have pouches.

24
00:01:36.898 --> 00:01:39.041
We can catch lots of fish with them.

25
00:01:41.683 --> 00:01:42.284
I'm hungry.

26
00:01:44.046 --> 00:01:44.847
See you later.

27
00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:49.571
Good-bye, Brown Pelican!
